00:24:46.320 --> 00:24:51.840
differential equations and essentially what we can&nbsp;
do is through a very similar nonlinear autoencoder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:51.840 --> 00:24:57.280
network we can learn these non-linear analogs&nbsp;
